USER -> UI : pilih gambar\n(jpg/png/webp, maks 2MB)
activate UI

UI -> API : POST FormData\n{file: imageFile}\n[Cookie: token=...]
activate API

API -> JWT : verifyToken(token cookie)
activate JWT
JWT --> API : payload {userId}
deactivate JWT

