activate DB
DB --> API : updatedUser
deactivate DB

API --> UI : HTTP 200\n{message: "Upload berhasil"\nurl: publicUrl, user: updatedUser}\n[Cache-Control: no-store]
deactivate API

UI --> USER : foto profil diperbarui
deactivate UI

