activate UI

UI -> API : GET /api/chat\n?userId={id}&type=list\n[Cookie: token=...]
activate API

API -> SESSION : getSession()
activate SESSION
SESSION --> API : {userId} | null
deactivate SESSION

alt Tidak ada sesi || userId param != session.userId
  API --> UI : HTTP 401 "Unauthorized"
